# package-as MUST stay Daseeki-Bags: the folder name is the addon's identity. It is what
# names the SavedVariables file (WTF/.../SavedVariables/Daseeki-Bags.lua), what the client
# matches the .toc against, and what makes the 2.0 cutover an in-place upgrade instead of a
# second addon. Release-gate C.11. Do not "modernise" it to Daseeki-Bags2.
package-as: Daseeki-Bags
license-output: LICENSE
ignore:
  - README.md
  - CHANGELOG.md
  - .github
  # Developer tooling: never shipped to users. harness/ carries the self-test runner, its
  # 1.x fixtures and a probe that walks the machine's AddOns folder; dev/ regenerates the
  # icon art. Both were harmless while 2.0 only ever reached the game through a local
  # junction; 2.0.0 is the first PACKAGED release of this tree, so they are excluded here.
  - harness
  - dev
